window.Apuntes.registrarPane("pyl/u3/practica", "<section class=\"pane\" data-view=\"pyl/u3/practica\" data-tab-owner=\"practica\">\n  <h1>Unidad 3 &mdash; Pr\u00e1ctica: de ER a AFD m\u00ednimo</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"pane-intro\">\n    Siete ER inventadas con la forma del ejercicio 2 del parcial (60 puntos), de menor a mayor\n    dificultad. Cada una resuelta entera: Thompson, subconjuntos, AFD, minimizaci\u00f3n y la prueba con\n    cadenas. Hac\u00e9 cada una en la hoja primero y despu\u00e9s compar\u00e1 paso por paso.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 2\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 2 del parcial (60 puntos), con otra ER.\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 1 &middot; ER &rarr; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <h2>(a|b)*b</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Dada la siguiente ER, pasar a aut\u00f3mata determin\u00edstico m\u00ednimo: <strong>(a|b)*b</strong></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 lenguaje genera</span>\n    <p>\n      <code>(a|b)*</code> es \"cualquier cadena de a y b, incluso la vac\u00eda\"; despu\u00e9s viene una\n      <code>b</code> obligatoria. En palabras: <strong>las cadenas sobre {a, b} que terminan en b</strong>.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>b</code>, <code>ab</code>, <code>bb</code>, <code>abab</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>a</code>, <code>ba</code>, <code>abba</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Esto no es parte de la respuesta, pero sirve para controlar el AFD al final.</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; AFN-\u03b5 con Thompson</span>\n    <p>Se arma de adentro hacia afuera, en el orden en que se eval\u00faa la ER:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><code>a</code> y <code>b</code>: un aut\u00f3mata de dos estados cada uno.</li>\n      <li><code>a|b</code>: un estado inicial nuevo con \u03b5 a cada uno y un final nuevo al que llegan los dos con \u03b5.</li>\n      <li><code>(a|b)*</code>: dos estados m\u00e1s; \u03b5 para entrar, \u03b5 para salir, \u03b5 de vuelta (repetir) y \u03b5 para saltearlo (cero veces).</li>\n      <li><code>(a|b)*b</code>: concatenaci\u00f3n; el final de <code>(a|b)*</code> pasa a ser el inicial de <code>b</code> (es el mismo estado, el 7).</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e1-thompson\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -119 572 231\" width=\"572\" height=\"231\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para (a|b)*b\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,-36.0 L221.0,-36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,-36.0 L212.0,-31.5 L212.0,-40.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-46.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,36.0 L221.0,36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,36.0 L212.0,40.5 L212.0,31.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M97.3,-7.8 L142.7,-28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,-28.2 L136.3,-20.4 L132.6,-28.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"115.3\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M97.3,7.8 L142.7,28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,28.2 L132.6,28.6 L136.3,20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"124.7\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M257.3,-28.2 L302.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,-7.8 L292.6,-7.4 L296.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"284.7\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M257.3,28.2 L302.7,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,7.8 L296.3,15.6 L292.6,7.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"275.3\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L61.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M61.0,0.0 L52.0,4.5 L52.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"40.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M339.0,0.0 L381.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M381.0,0.0 L372.0,4.5 L372.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M308.6,-15.2 Q200.0,-160.0 91.4,-15.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M91.4,-15.2 L93.2,-25.1 L100.4,-19.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-97.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M15.1,11.5 Q200.0,152.0 384.9,11.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M384.9,11.5 L380.4,20.5 L375.0,13.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"91.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M419.0,0.0 L461.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M461.0,0.0 L452.0,4.5 L452.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"440.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">6</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">7</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"480.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">8</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Subconjuntos (AFN-\u03b5 &rarr; AFD)</span>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Estado inicial:</strong> <code>A = \u03b5-clausura({0})</code>. Desde el 0, solo con \u03b5, se\n      llega al 1 y al 7; desde el 1, al 2 y al 3. Entonces <code>A = {0, 1, 2, 3, 7}</code>.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <strong>C\u00f3mo sale cada casilla</strong>, con <code>A</code> y la <code>b</code>:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>mueve(A, b)</code>: desde los estados de A, \u00bfcu\u00e1les tienen una flecha <code>b</code>? El 3 (va al 5) y el 7 (va al 8). Resultado: <code>{5, 8}</code>.</li>\n      <li><code>\u03b5-clausura({5, 8})</code>: desde el 5 y el 8, todo lo que se alcanza solo con \u03b5. 5 &rarr; 6 &rarr; 1 y 7; 1 &rarr; 2 y 3. Del 8 no sale nada. Resultado: <code>{1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8}</code>, que es nuevo: se llama <code>C</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Se repite para cada estado nuevo y cada s\u00edmbolo, hasta que no aparezcan estados nuevos:</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado del AFD</th><th>Estados de Thompson</th><th>mueve(T, a)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con a va a</th><th>mueve(T, b)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con b va a</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">A</td><td>{0, 1, 2, 3, 7}</td><td>{4}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 7} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>{5, 8}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8} = <strong>C</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 7}</td><td>{4}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 7} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>{5, 8}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8} = <strong>C</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C (final)</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8}</td><td>{4}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 7} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>{5, 8}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8} = <strong>C</strong></td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Finales del AFD:</strong> los que contienen el final de Thompson (el 8). Solo\n      <code>C</code>.\n    </p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; El AFD</span>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; A</td><td>B</td><td>C</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B</td><td>B</td><td>C</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C *</td><td>B</td><td>C</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e1-afd\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -52 284 264\" width=\"284\" height=\"264\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M16.8,71.2 L135.2,8.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M135.2,8.8 L129.3,17.0 L125.1,9.1 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"70.5\" y=\"29.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M16.8,88.8 L135.2,151.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M135.2,151.2 L125.1,150.9 L129.3,143.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"81.5\" y=\"109.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.8,-8.9 C203.2,-40.0 203.2,40.0 168.8,8.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.8,8.9 L178.5,11.6 L172.4,18.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"206.8\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M159.8,17.3 Q188.0,80.0 159.8,142.7\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M159.8,142.7 L159.4,132.6 L167.6,136.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"187.7\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M144.2,142.7 Q116.0,80.0 144.2,17.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M144.2,17.3 L144.6,27.4 L136.4,23.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"116.3\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.8,151.1 C203.2,120.0 203.2,200.0 168.8,168.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.8,168.9 L178.5,171.6 L172.4,178.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"206.8\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,80.0 L-19.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,80.0 L-28.0,84.5 L-28.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 5 &mdash; Minimizaci\u00f3n</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>P1</strong> = {C} &nbsp; {A, B} (finales y no finales).</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, B}: con <code>a</code>, A va a B y B va a B (los dos al grupo {A, B}); con\n        <code>b</code>, los dos van a C (grupo {C}). <strong>Se comportan igual: no se separan.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P2</strong> = P1: no cambia, se termina.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>A y B se juntan en un solo estado (lo llamamos A).</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 6 &mdash; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e1-min\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 273 130\" width=\"273\" height=\"130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,-7.8 Q80.0,-36.0 142.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,-7.8 L132.6,-7.4 L136.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M142.7,7.8 Q80.0,36.0 17.3,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M17.3,7.8 L27.4,7.4 L23.7,15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M151.1,-16.8 C120.0,-51.2 200.0,-51.2 168.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.9,-16.8 L171.6,-26.5 L178.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p>\n        AFD m\u00ednimo de dos estados: <code>A</code> (inicial, no final) y <code>C</code> (final).\n        Con <code>a</code> los dos van a A; con <code>b</code> los dos van a C.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>ab</code></td><td>A &rarr;a A &rarr;b C</td><td>S\u00ed: termina en b</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>abba</code></td><td>A &rarr;a A &rarr;b C &rarr;b C &rarr;a A</td><td>No: termina en a</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\u03b5</code></td><td>se queda en A</td><td>No: A no es final</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>La \u03b5-clausura <strong>incluye al propio estado</strong>: <code>\u03b5-clausura({5, 8})</code> tiene al 5 y al 8.</li>\n        <li>En <code>mueve</code> no se siguen las \u03b5: solo el paso con el s\u00edmbolo. Las \u03b5 se siguen despu\u00e9s, en la clausura.</li>\n        <li>Dos estados del AFD con distintos conjuntos (A y B) pueden ser equivalentes: por eso se minimiza.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 2\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 2 del parcial (60 puntos), con otra ER.\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 2 &middot; ER &rarr; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <h2>a|bc*</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Dada la siguiente ER, pasar a aut\u00f3mata determin\u00edstico m\u00ednimo: <strong>a|bc*</strong></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 lenguaje genera</span>\n    <p>\n      El <code>*</code> pega m\u00e1s fuerte que la concatenaci\u00f3n y que el <code>|</code>: se lee\n      <code>a | (b(c*))</code>. En palabras: <strong>la cadena <code>a</code> sola, o una\n      <code>b</code> seguida de cualquier cantidad de <code>c</code></strong>.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>a</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>bc</code>, <code>bccc</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>ac</code>, <code>bcb</code>, <code>c</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Esto no es parte de la respuesta, pero sirve para controlar el AFD al final.</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; AFN-\u03b5 con Thompson</span>\n    <p>Se arma de adentro hacia afuera, en el orden en que se eval\u00faa la ER:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><code>a</code>, <code>b</code> y <code>c</code>: un aut\u00f3mata de dos estados cada uno (1 &rarr;a 3, 2 &rarr;b 4, 5 &rarr;c 6).</li>\n      <li><code>c*</code>: \u03b5 para entrar (4 &rarr; 5), \u03b5 de vuelta (6 &rarr; 5), \u03b5 para salir (6 &rarr; 7) y \u03b5 para saltearlo (4 &rarr; 7).</li>\n      <li><code>bc*</code>: concatenaci\u00f3n; el final de <code>b</code> y el inicial de <code>c*</code> son el mismo estado, el 4.</li>\n      <li><code>a|bc*</code>: un inicial nuevo (0) con \u03b5 a cada rama y un final nuevo (8) al que llegan las dos con \u03b5.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e2-thompson\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -67 572 239\" width=\"572\" height=\"239\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para a|bc*\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,-36.0 L141.0,-36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,-36.0 L132.0,-31.5 L132.0,-40.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-46.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,96.0 L141.0,96.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,96.0 L132.0,100.5 L132.0,91.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"86.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M259.0,96.0 L301.0,96.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,96.0 L292.0,100.5 L292.0,91.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"86.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,96.0 L221.0,96.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,96.0 L212.0,100.5 L212.0,91.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"86.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M339.0,96.0 L381.0,96.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M381.0,96.0 L372.0,100.5 L372.0,91.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"86.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M312.1,78.7 Q280.0,8.0 247.9,78.7\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M247.9,78.7 L247.5,68.6 L255.7,72.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"33.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M175.8,106.5 Q280.0,176.0 384.2,106.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M384.2,106.5 L379.2,115.3 L374.2,107.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"151.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,-7.8 L62.7,-28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M62.7,-28.2 L56.3,-20.4 L52.6,-28.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"35.3\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M12.2,14.6 L67.8,81.4\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M67.8,81.4 L58.6,77.4 L65.5,71.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"49.9\" y=\"39.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M178.9,-33.9 L461.1,-2.1\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M461.1,-2.1 L451.7,1.3 L452.7,-7.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"321.2\" y=\"-28.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M412.2,81.4 L467.8,14.6\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M467.8,14.6 L465.5,24.4 L458.6,18.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"430.1\" y=\"39.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"96.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"96.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"96.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"96.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"96.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"96.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"96.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"96.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">6</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"96.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"96.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">7</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"480.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">8</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Subconjuntos (AFN-\u03b5 &rarr; AFD)</span>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Estado inicial:</strong> <code>A = \u03b5-clausura({0})</code>. Desde el 0, solo con \u03b5, se\n      llega al 1 y al 2, y de ah\u00ed no salen m\u00e1s \u03b5. Entonces <code>A = {0, 1, 2}</code>.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <strong>C\u00f3mo sale cada casilla</strong>, con <code>A</code> y la <code>b</code>:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>mueve(A, b)</code>: de los estados de A, solo el 2 tiene una flecha <code>b</code> (va al 4). Resultado: <code>{4}</code>.</li>\n      <li><code>\u03b5-clausura({4})</code>: 4 &rarr; 5 y 4 &rarr; 7 (entrar y saltear el <code>c*</code>); 7 &rarr; 8. Resultado: <code>{4, 5, 7, 8}</code>, que es nuevo: se llama <code>C</code>. Tiene al 8, as\u00ed que es final (<code>b</code> sola se acepta).</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>\n      Y con <code>A</code> y la <code>c</code>: ning\u00fan estado de A tiene flecha <code>c</code>, as\u00ed que\n      <code>mueve(A, c) = \u2205</code>. Ese conjunto vac\u00edo tambi\u00e9n es un estado del AFD: el\n      <strong>estado muerto</strong> <code>\u2205</code>, que con cualquier s\u00edmbolo vuelve a s\u00ed mismo.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado del AFD</th><th>Estados de Thompson</th><th>mueve(T, a)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con a va a</th><th>mueve(T, b)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con b va a</th><th>mueve(T, c)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con c va a</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">A</td><td>{0, 1, 2}</td><td>{3}</td><td>{3, 8} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>{4}</td><td>{4, 5, 7, 8} = <strong>C</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B (final)</td><td>{3, 8}</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C (final)</td><td>{4, 5, 7, 8}</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>{6}</td><td>{5, 6, 7, 8} = <strong>D</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D (final)</td><td>{5, 6, 7, 8}</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>{6}</td><td>{5, 6, 7, 8} = <strong>D</strong></td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Finales del AFD:</strong> los que contienen el final de Thompson (el 8):\n      <code>B</code>, <code>C</code> y <code>D</code>.\n    </p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; El AFD</span>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>a</th><th>b</th><th>c</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; A</td><td>B</td><td>C</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B *</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C *</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>D</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D *</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>D</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e2-afd\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -31 497 323\" width=\"497\" height=\"323\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.0,71.5 L143.0,8.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.0,8.5 L137.0,16.5 L132.9,8.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"74.8\" y=\"29.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.0,88.5 L143.0,151.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.0,151.5 L132.9,151.5 L137.0,143.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"85.2\" y=\"109.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,80.0 L301.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,80.0 L292.0,84.5 L292.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"70.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.0,8.5 L303.0,71.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M303.0,71.5 L292.9,71.5 L297.0,63.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"249.8\" y=\"20.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b, c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.0,151.5 L303.0,88.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M303.0,88.5 L297.0,96.5 L292.9,88.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"232.5\" y=\"105.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.0,168.5 L303.0,231.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M303.0,231.5 L292.9,231.5 L297.0,223.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"245.2\" y=\"189.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M320.0,221.0 L320.0,99.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M320.0,99.0 L324.5,108.0 L315.5,108.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"294.8\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M336.8,231.1 C371.2,200.0 371.2,280.0 336.8,248.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M336.8,248.9 L346.5,251.6 L340.4,258.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"374.8\" y=\"240.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M336.8,71.1 C371.2,40.0 371.2,120.0 336.8,88.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M336.8,88.9 L346.5,91.6 L340.4,98.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"397.6\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b, c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,80.0 L-19.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,80.0 L-28.0,84.5 L-28.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"240.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"240.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"240.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">D</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 5 &mdash; Minimizaci\u00f3n</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>P1</strong> = {B, C, D} &nbsp; {A, \u2205} (finales y no finales; el \u2205 va con los no finales).</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {B, C, D}: con <code>a</code> y con <code>b</code> los tres van a \u2205 (grupo {A, \u2205}).\n        Con <code>c</code>, B va a \u2205 (grupo {A, \u2205}), pero C y D van a D (grupo {B, C, D}).\n        <strong>B se separa; C y D siguen juntos.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, \u2205}: con <code>a</code>, A va a B (finales) y \u2205 va a \u2205 (no finales).\n        <strong>Se separan.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P2</strong> = {B} &nbsp; {C, D} &nbsp; {A} &nbsp; {\u2205}</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {C, D}: con <code>a</code> y <code>b</code> los dos van a \u2205; con <code>c</code> los dos\n        van a D. Se comportan igual.\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P3</strong> = P2: no cambia, se termina.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>C y D se juntan en un solo estado (lo llamamos C).</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 6 &mdash; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e2-min\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -31 497 268\" width=\"497\" height=\"268\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.0,71.5 L143.0,8.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.0,8.5 L137.0,16.5 L132.9,8.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"74.8\" y=\"29.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.0,88.5 L143.0,151.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.0,151.5 L132.9,151.5 L137.0,143.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"85.2\" y=\"109.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,80.0 L301.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,80.0 L292.0,84.5 L292.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"70.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.0,8.5 L303.0,71.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M303.0,71.5 L292.9,71.5 L297.0,63.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"249.8\" y=\"20.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b, c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.0,151.5 L303.0,88.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M303.0,88.5 L297.0,96.5 L292.9,88.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"232.5\" y=\"105.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.9,176.8 C200.0,211.2 120.0,211.2 151.1,176.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M151.1,176.8 L148.4,186.5 L141.7,180.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"216.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M336.8,71.1 C371.2,40.0 371.2,120.0 336.8,88.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M336.8,88.9 L346.5,91.6 L340.4,98.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"397.6\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b, c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,80.0 L-19.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,80.0 L-28.0,84.5 L-28.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p>\n        AFD m\u00ednimo de cuatro estados: <code>A</code> (inicial), <code>B</code> y <code>C</code>\n        (finales) y el muerto <code>\u2205</code>. A va a B con <code>a</code> y a C con <code>b</code>;\n        C se queda en C con <code>c</code>. Todo lo dem\u00e1s va a \u2205.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>a</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B</td><td>S\u00ed: B es final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>bcc</code></td><td>A &rarr;b C &rarr;c C &rarr;c C</td><td>S\u00ed: b y despu\u00e9s c</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>ac</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B &rarr;c \u2205</td><td>No: despu\u00e9s de la a no puede venir nada</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>bcb</code></td><td>A &rarr;b C &rarr;c C &rarr;b \u2205</td><td>No: hay una b despu\u00e9s de las c</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Leer <code>a|bc*</code> como <code>(a|b)c*</code>: el <code>|</code> es lo \u00faltimo que se aplica, as\u00ed que la <code>a</code> va sola.</li>\n        <li>Cuando <code>mueve</code> da vac\u00edo no se deja la casilla en blanco: va <code>\u2205</code>, y \u2205 es una fila m\u00e1s de la tabla.</li>\n        <li>En P1 el \u2205 va con los no finales. No se lo deja afuera de la minimizaci\u00f3n.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 2\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 2 del parcial (60 puntos), con otra ER.\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 3 &middot; ER &rarr; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <h2>(ab)*a</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Dada la siguiente ER, pasar a aut\u00f3mata determin\u00edstico m\u00ednimo: <strong>(ab)*a</strong></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 lenguaje genera</span>\n    <p>\n      <code>(ab)*</code> es \"el bloque <code>ab</code> repetido cero o m\u00e1s veces\"; despu\u00e9s viene una\n      <code>a</code> obligatoria. En palabras: <strong>a, aba, ababa...: a y b alternadas, empezando y\n      terminando en a</strong>.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>a</code>, <code>aba</code>, <code>ababa</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>ab</code>, <code>aa</code>, <code>abba</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Esto no es parte de la respuesta, pero sirve para controlar el AFD al final.</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; AFN-\u03b5 con Thompson</span>\n    <p>Se arma de adentro hacia afuera, en el orden en que se eval\u00faa la ER:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><code>ab</code>: concatenaci\u00f3n de <code>a</code> y <code>b</code>; el final de una es el inicial de la otra: 1 &rarr;a 2 &rarr;b 3.</li>\n      <li><code>(ab)*</code>: \u03b5 para entrar (0 &rarr; 1), \u03b5 de vuelta (3 &rarr; 1), \u03b5 para salir (3 &rarr; 4) y \u03b5 para saltearlo (0 &rarr; 4).</li>\n      <li><code>(ab)*a</code>: concatenaci\u00f3n; el final de <code>(ab)*</code> es el inicial de la <code>a</code> (el 4): 4 &rarr;a 5.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e3-thompson\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -82 492 157\" width=\"492\" height=\"157\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para (ab)*a\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,0.0 L221.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,0.0 L212.0,4.5 L212.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L61.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M61.0,0.0 L52.0,4.5 L52.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"40.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M259.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M227.2,-14.1 Q160.0,-88.0 92.8,-14.1\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M92.8,-14.1 L95.5,-23.7 L102.2,-17.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-61.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.0,8.5 Q160.0,80.0 303.0,8.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M303.0,8.5 L297.0,16.5 L292.9,8.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"54.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M339.0,0.0 L381.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M381.0,0.0 L372.0,4.5 L372.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Subconjuntos (AFN-\u03b5 &rarr; AFD)</span>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Estado inicial:</strong> <code>A = \u03b5-clausura({0})</code>. Desde el 0, con \u03b5, se llega\n      al 1 (entrar) y al 4 (saltear). Entonces <code>A = {0, 1, 4}</code>.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <strong>C\u00f3mo sale cada casilla</strong>, con <code>A</code> y la <code>a</code>:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>mueve(A, a)</code>: hay <strong>dos</strong> flechas <code>a</code> que salen de A: 1 &rarr; 2 y 4 &rarr; 5. Resultado: <code>{2, 5}</code>.</li>\n      <li><code>\u03b5-clausura({2, 5})</code>: del 2 y del 5 no sale ninguna \u03b5, as\u00ed que queda <code>{2, 5}</code> (la clausura siempre incluye a los propios estados). Es nuevo: <code>B</code>, y es final porque tiene al 5.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>\n      Despu\u00e9s, con <code>B</code> y la <code>b</code>: <code>mueve(B, b) = {3}</code> y\n      <code>\u03b5-clausura({3}) = {1, 3, 4}</code> (volver y salir del <code>*</code>): es <code>C</code>.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado del AFD</th><th>Estados de Thompson</th><th>mueve(T, a)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con a va a</th><th>mueve(T, b)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con b va a</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">A</td><td>{0, 1, 4}</td><td>{2, 5}</td><td>{2, 5} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B (final)</td><td>{2, 5}</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>{3}</td><td>{1, 3, 4} = <strong>C</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C</td><td>{1, 3, 4}</td><td>{2, 5}</td><td>{2, 5} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Finales del AFD:</strong> los que contienen el final de Thompson (el 5). Solo\n      <code>B</code>.\n    </p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; El AFD</span>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; A</td><td>B</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B *</td><td>\u2205</td><td>C</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C</td><td>B</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e3-afd\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -53 412 274\" width=\"412\" height=\"274\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M14.1,12.7 L145.9,131.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M145.9,131.3 L136.2,128.6 L142.2,121.9 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"88.4\" y=\"62.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M160.0,19.0 L160.0,125.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M160.0,125.0 L155.5,116.0 L164.5,116.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"146.2\" y=\"72.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,-7.8 Q240.0,-36.0 302.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,-7.8 L292.6,-7.4 L296.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M302.7,7.8 Q240.0,36.0 177.3,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M177.3,7.8 L187.4,7.4 L183.7,15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M305.9,12.7 L174.1,131.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M174.1,131.3 L177.8,121.9 L183.8,128.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"231.6\" y=\"62.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.9,160.8 C200.0,195.2 120.0,195.2 151.1,160.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M151.1,160.8 L148.4,170.5 L141.7,164.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"200.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"144.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"144.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 5 &mdash; Minimizaci\u00f3n</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>P1</strong> = {B} &nbsp; {A, C, \u2205} (finales y no finales).</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, C, \u2205}: con <code>a</code>, A y C van a B (grupo {B}), pero \u2205 va a \u2205 (grupo\n        {A, C, \u2205}). Con <code>b</code>, los tres van a \u2205. <strong>\u2205 se separa; A y C siguen juntos.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P2</strong> = {B} &nbsp; {A, C} &nbsp; {\u2205}</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, C}: con <code>a</code> los dos van a B; con <code>b</code> los dos van a \u2205. Se\n        comportan igual.\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P3</strong> = P2: no cambia, se termina.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>A y C se juntan en un solo estado (lo llamamos A).</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 6 &mdash; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e3-min\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -53 252 274\" width=\"252\" height=\"274\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,-7.8 Q80.0,-36.0 142.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,-7.8 L132.6,-7.4 L136.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M9.2,16.6 L70.8,127.4\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M70.8,127.4 L62.5,121.7 L70.3,117.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"51.6\" y=\"65.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M150.8,16.6 L89.2,127.4\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M89.2,127.4 L89.7,117.3 L97.5,121.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"108.4\" y=\"65.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M142.7,7.8 Q80.0,36.0 17.3,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M17.3,7.8 L27.4,7.4 L23.7,15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M88.9,160.8 C120.0,195.2 40.0,195.2 71.1,160.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M71.1,160.8 L68.4,170.5 L61.7,164.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"200.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"144.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"144.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p>\n        AFD m\u00ednimo de tres estados: <code>A</code> (inicial), <code>B</code> (final) y el muerto\n        <code>\u2205</code>. A va a B con <code>a</code>; B vuelve a A con <code>b</code>. Una\n        <code>b</code> desde A o una <code>a</code> desde B van a \u2205.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>a</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B</td><td>S\u00ed: cero veces <code>ab</code> y la a</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>aba</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B &rarr;b A &rarr;a B</td><td>S\u00ed: una vez <code>ab</code> y la a</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>ab</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B &rarr;b A</td><td>No: falta la a del final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>aa</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B &rarr;a \u2205</td><td>No: dos a seguidas</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>En <code>mueve(A, a)</code> hay que juntar <strong>todas</strong> las flechas <code>a</code> que salen de A: quedarse solo con la del 1 pierde el final.</li>\n        <li>Si de un estado no sale ninguna \u03b5, su \u03b5-clausura es \u00e9l mismo, no \u2205.</li>\n        <li>A y C son conjuntos distintos pero hacen lo mismo: C es \"termin\u00e9 un <code>ab</code>\", que es como estar al principio.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 2\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 2 del parcial (60 puntos), con otra ER.\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 4 &middot; ER &rarr; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <h2>a(b|\u03b5)c*</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Dada la siguiente ER, pasar a aut\u00f3mata determin\u00edstico m\u00ednimo: <strong>a(b|\u03b5)c*</strong></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 lenguaje genera</span>\n    <p>\n      Una <code>a</code>; despu\u00e9s <code>(b|\u03b5)</code>, que es \"una <code>b</code> o nada\" (la b es\n      opcional); al final, cualquier cantidad de <code>c</code>. En palabras: <strong>una a,\n      opcionalmente una b, y despu\u00e9s c (cero o m\u00e1s)</strong>.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>a</code>, <code>ab</code>, <code>ac</code>, <code>abcc</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>abb</code>, <code>acb</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Esto no es parte de la respuesta, pero sirve para controlar el AFD al final.</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; AFN-\u03b5 con Thompson</span>\n    <p>Se arma de adentro hacia afuera, en el orden en que se eval\u00faa la ER:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><code>a</code>: 0 &rarr;a 1.</li>\n      <li><code>b|\u03b5</code>: la <code>\u03b5</code> se arma como un s\u00edmbolo m\u00e1s (dos estados con una flecha \u03b5: 3 &rarr; 5). Un inicial con \u03b5 a cada rama (al 2 y al 3) y un final (6) al que llegan las dos con \u03b5.</li>\n      <li><code>c*</code>: \u03b5 para entrar (6 &rarr; 7), \u03b5 de vuelta (8 &rarr; 7), \u03b5 para salir (8 &rarr; 9) y \u03b5 para saltearlo (6 &rarr; 9).</li>\n      <li>Las dos concatenaciones funden estados: el final de <code>a</code> es el inicial de <code>b|\u03b5</code> (el 1) y el final de <code>b|\u03b5</code> es el inicial de <code>c*</code> (el 6).</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e4-thompson\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -84 652 160\" width=\"652\" height=\"160\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para a(b|\u03b5)c*\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L61.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M61.0,0.0 L52.0,4.5 L52.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"40.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,-36.0 L221.0,-36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,-36.0 L212.0,-31.5 L212.0,-40.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-46.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,36.0 L221.0,36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,36.0 L212.0,40.5 L212.0,31.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M97.3,-7.8 L142.7,-28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,-28.2 L136.3,-20.4 L132.6,-28.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"115.3\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M97.3,7.8 L142.7,28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,28.2 L132.6,28.6 L136.3,20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"124.7\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M257.3,-28.2 L302.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,-7.8 L292.6,-7.4 L296.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"284.7\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M257.3,28.2 L302.7,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,7.8 L296.3,15.6 L292.6,7.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"275.3\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M419.0,0.0 L461.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M461.0,0.0 L452.0,4.5 L452.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"440.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M339.0,0.0 L381.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M381.0,0.0 L372.0,4.5 L372.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M499.0,0.0 L541.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M541.0,0.0 L532.0,4.5 L532.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"520.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M472.1,-17.3 Q440.0,-88.0 407.9,-17.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M407.9,-17.3 L407.5,-27.4 L415.7,-23.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"440.0\" y=\"-62.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M335.8,10.5 Q440.0,80.0 544.2,10.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M544.2,10.5 L539.2,19.3 L534.2,11.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"440.0\" y=\"55.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">6</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">7</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"480.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">8</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"560.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"560.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"560.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">9</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Subconjuntos (AFN-\u03b5 &rarr; AFD)</span>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Estado inicial:</strong> <code>A = \u03b5-clausura({0})</code>. Del 0 no sale ninguna \u03b5 (solo\n      la <code>a</code>). Entonces <code>A = {0}</code>.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <strong>C\u00f3mo sale cada casilla</strong>, con <code>A</code> y la <code>a</code>:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>mueve(A, a)</code>: 0 &rarr; 1. Resultado: <code>{1}</code>.</li>\n      <li>\n        <code>\u03b5-clausura({1})</code>: 1 &rarr; 2 y 1 &rarr; 3 (las dos ramas); 3 &rarr; 5 (la rama de la\n        \u03b5) y 5 &rarr; 6; 6 &rarr; 7 y 6 &rarr; 9 (entrar y saltear el <code>c*</code>). Resultado:\n        <code>{1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 9}</code> = <code>B</code>. Tiene al 9: es final, porque la\n        <code>a</code> sola ya es una cadena del lenguaje.\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado del AFD</th><th>Estados de Thompson</th><th>mueve(T, a)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con a va a</th><th>mueve(T, b)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con b va a</th><th>mueve(T, c)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con c va a</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">A</td><td>{0}</td><td>{1}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 9} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B (final)</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 9}</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>{4}</td><td>{4, 6, 7, 9} = <strong>C</strong></td><td>{8}</td><td>{7, 8, 9} = <strong>D</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C (final)</td><td>{4, 6, 7, 9}</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>{8}</td><td>{7, 8, 9} = <strong>D</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D (final)</td><td>{7, 8, 9}</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>{8}</td><td>{7, 8, 9} = <strong>D</strong></td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Finales del AFD:</strong> los que contienen el final de Thompson (el 9):\n      <code>B</code>, <code>C</code> y <code>D</code>.\n    </p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; El AFD</span>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>a</th><th>b</th><th>c</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; A</td><td>B</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B *</td><td>\u2205</td><td>C</td><td>D</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C *</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>D</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D *</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>D</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e4-afd\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -75 612 312\" width=\"612\" height=\"312\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M15.8,10.5 L224.2,149.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M224.2,149.5 L214.2,148.2 L219.2,140.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"130.2\" y=\"64.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b, c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.5,17.0 L231.5,143.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M231.5,143.0 L223.5,137.0 L231.5,132.9 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"212.0\" y=\"74.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.0,-8.5 Q320.0,-80.0 463.0,-8.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M463.0,-8.5 L452.9,-8.5 L457.0,-16.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"-54.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M311.5,17.0 L248.5,143.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M248.5,143.0 L248.5,132.9 L256.5,137.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"258.9\" y=\"69.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M339.0,0.0 L461.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M461.0,0.0 L452.0,4.5 L452.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M464.2,10.5 L255.8,149.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M255.8,149.5 L260.8,140.7 L265.8,148.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"349.8\" y=\"64.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M496.8,-8.9 C531.2,-40.0 531.2,40.0 496.8,8.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M496.8,8.9 L506.5,11.6 L500.4,18.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"534.8\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M248.9,176.8 C280.0,211.2 200.0,211.2 231.1,176.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M231.1,176.8 L228.4,186.5 L221.7,180.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"216.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b, c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"480.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">D</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 5 &mdash; Minimizaci\u00f3n</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>P1</strong> = {B, C, D} &nbsp; {A, \u2205} (finales y no finales).</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {B, C, D}: con <code>a</code> los tres van a \u2205; con <code>c</code> los tres van a D.\n        Con <code>b</code>, B va a C (finales), pero C y D van a \u2205 (no finales).\n        <strong>B se separa; C y D siguen juntos.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, \u2205}: con <code>a</code>, A va a B (finales) y \u2205 va a \u2205. <strong>Se separan.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P2</strong> = {B} &nbsp; {C, D} &nbsp; {A} &nbsp; {\u2205}</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {C, D}: con <code>a</code> y <code>b</code> los dos van a \u2205; con <code>c</code> los dos\n        van a D. Se comportan igual.\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P3</strong> = P2: no cambia, se termina.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>C y D se juntan en un solo estado (lo llamamos C).</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 6 &mdash; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e4-min\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -52 452 273\" width=\"452\" height=\"273\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M14.1,12.7 L145.9,131.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M145.9,131.3 L136.2,128.6 L142.2,121.9 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"93.5\" y=\"57.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b, c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M160.0,19.0 L160.0,125.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M160.0,125.0 L155.5,116.0 L164.5,116.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"146.2\" y=\"72.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b, c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M305.9,12.7 L174.1,131.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M174.1,131.3 L177.8,121.9 L183.8,128.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"226.5\" y=\"57.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M336.8,-8.9 C371.2,-40.0 371.2,40.0 336.8,8.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M336.8,8.9 L346.5,11.6 L340.4,18.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"374.8\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.9,160.8 C200.0,195.2 120.0,195.2 151.1,160.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M151.1,160.8 L148.4,170.5 L141.7,164.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"200.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b, c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"144.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"144.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p>\n        AFD m\u00ednimo de cuatro estados: <code>A</code> (inicial), <code>B</code> y <code>C</code>\n        (finales) y el muerto <code>\u2205</code>. A va a B con <code>a</code>; B va a C con\n        <code>b</code> o con <code>c</code>; C se queda en C con <code>c</code>. Todo lo dem\u00e1s va a \u2205.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>a</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B</td><td>S\u00ed: sin b y sin c</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>abcc</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B &rarr;b C &rarr;c C &rarr;c C</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>abb</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B &rarr;b C &rarr;b \u2205</td><td>No: la b va una sola vez</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>acb</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B &rarr;c C &rarr;b \u2205</td><td>No: la b no puede ir despu\u00e9s de las c</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>La <code>\u03b5</code> de la ER no se borra: es una rama del <code>|</code> con su propia flecha \u03b5 (3 &rarr; 5).</li>\n        <li>Si en la clausura no se sigue esa rama, B no llega al 9 y queda como no final: el AFD rechazar\u00eda <code>a</code>.</li>\n        <li>B, C y D son finales los tres, pero B no es equivalente a los otros: es el \u00fanico que todav\u00eda acepta una <code>b</code>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 2\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 2 del parcial (60 puntos), con otra ER.\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 5 &middot; ER &rarr; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <h2>(a|ba)*b</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Dada la siguiente ER, pasar a aut\u00f3mata determin\u00edstico m\u00ednimo: <strong>(a|ba)*b</strong></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 lenguaje genera</span>\n    <p>\n      <code>(a|ba)*</code> arma cadenas con los bloques <code>a</code> y <code>ba</code>: toda\n      <code>b</code> queda seguida de una <code>a</code>. Despu\u00e9s viene una <code>b</code>\n      obligatoria. En palabras: <strong>las cadenas sobre {a, b} que terminan en b y no tienen dos b\n      seguidas</strong>.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>b</code>, <code>ab</code>, <code>bab</code>, <code>abaab</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>a</code>, <code>bb</code>, <code>abba</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Esto no es parte de la respuesta, pero sirve para controlar el AFD al final.</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; AFN-\u03b5 con Thompson</span>\n    <p>Se arma de adentro hacia afuera, en el orden en que se eval\u00faa la ER:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><code>a</code>: 2 &rarr;a 4. <code>ba</code>: concatenaci\u00f3n, 3 &rarr;b 5 &rarr;a 6.</li>\n      <li><code>a|ba</code>: un inicial (1) con \u03b5 a cada rama y un final (7) al que llegan las dos con \u03b5.</li>\n      <li><code>(a|ba)*</code>: \u03b5 para entrar (0 &rarr; 1), \u03b5 de vuelta (7 &rarr; 1), \u03b5 para salir (7 &rarr; 8) y \u03b5 para saltearlo (0 &rarr; 8).</li>\n      <li><code>(a|ba)*b</code>: el final de la clausura es el inicial de la <code>b</code> (el 8): 8 &rarr;b 9.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e5-thompson\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -118 652 230\" width=\"652\" height=\"230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para (a|ba)*b\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,-36.0 L221.0,-36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,-36.0 L212.0,-31.5 L212.0,-40.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-46.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,36.0 L221.0,36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,36.0 L212.0,40.5 L212.0,31.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M259.0,36.0 L301.0,36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,36.0 L292.0,40.5 L292.0,31.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M97.3,-7.8 L142.7,-28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,-28.2 L136.3,-20.4 L132.6,-28.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"115.3\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M97.3,7.8 L142.7,28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,28.2 L132.6,28.6 L136.3,20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"124.7\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M258.5,-31.8 L381.5,-4.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M381.5,-4.2 L371.7,-1.8 L373.7,-10.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"322.4\" y=\"-28.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M337.3,28.2 L382.7,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M382.7,7.8 L376.3,15.6 L372.6,7.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"355.3\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L61.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M61.0,0.0 L52.0,4.5 L52.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"40.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M419.0,0.0 L461.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M461.0,0.0 L452.0,4.5 L452.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"440.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M386.6,-13.4 Q240.0,-160.0 93.4,-13.4\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M93.4,-13.4 L96.6,-23.0 L103.0,-16.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-96.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M16.1,10.2 Q240.0,152.0 463.9,10.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M463.9,10.2 L458.8,18.8 L453.9,11.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"91.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M499.0,0.0 L541.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M541.0,0.0 L532.0,4.5 L532.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"520.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">6</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">7</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"480.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">8</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"560.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"560.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"560.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">9</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Subconjuntos (AFN-\u03b5 &rarr; AFD)</span>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Estado inicial:</strong> <code>A = \u03b5-clausura({0})</code>. 0 &rarr; 1 y 0 &rarr; 8;\n      1 &rarr; 2 y 1 &rarr; 3. Entonces <code>A = {0, 1, 2, 3, 8}</code>.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <strong>C\u00f3mo sale cada casilla</strong>, con <code>A</code> y la <code>b</code>:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>mueve(A, b)</code>: hay dos flechas <code>b</code> desde A: 3 &rarr; 5 (la b de <code>ba</code>) y 8 &rarr; 9 (la b final). Resultado: <code>{5, 9}</code>.</li>\n      <li><code>\u03b5-clausura({5, 9})</code>: del 5 y del 9 no salen \u03b5. Queda <code>{5, 9}</code> = <code>C</code>. Es final (tiene al 9), pero con el 5 todav\u00eda puede seguir con una <code>a</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>\n      Con <code>C</code> y la <code>a</code>: <code>mueve(C, a) = {6}</code>;\n      <code>\u03b5-clausura({6})</code>: 6 &rarr; 7, 7 &rarr; 1 y 8, 1 &rarr; 2 y 3. Resultado\n      <code>{1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 8}</code> = <code>D</code>.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado del AFD</th><th>Estados de Thompson</th><th>mueve(T, a)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con a va a</th><th>mueve(T, b)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con b va a</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">A</td><td>{0, 1, 2, 3, 8}</td><td>{4}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 4, 7, 8} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>{5, 9}</td><td>{5, 9} = <strong>C</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 4, 7, 8}</td><td>{4}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 4, 7, 8} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>{5, 9}</td><td>{5, 9} = <strong>C</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C (final)</td><td>{5, 9}</td><td>{6}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 8} = <strong>D</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 8}</td><td>{4}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 4, 7, 8} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>{5, 9}</td><td>{5, 9} = <strong>C</strong></td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Finales del AFD:</strong> los que contienen el final de Thompson (el 9). Solo\n      <code>C</code>.\n    </p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; El AFD</span>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; A</td><td>B</td><td>C</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B</td><td>B</td><td>C</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C *</td><td>D</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D</td><td>B</td><td>C</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e5-afd\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 412 442\" width=\"412\" height=\"442\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.0,71.5 L143.0,8.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.0,8.5 L137.0,16.5 L132.9,8.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"74.8\" y=\"29.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.0,88.5 L143.0,151.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.0,151.5 L132.9,151.5 L137.0,143.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"85.2\" y=\"109.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M151.1,-16.8 C120.0,-51.2 200.0,-51.2 168.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.9,-16.8 L171.6,-26.5 L178.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M160.0,19.0 L160.0,141.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M160.0,141.0 L155.5,132.0 L164.5,132.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"146.2\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M172.6,145.8 Q223.9,87.8 301.1,81.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.1,81.5 L292.5,86.8 L291.7,77.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"225.1\" y=\"90.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M160.0,179.0 L160.0,269.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M160.0,269.0 L155.5,260.0 L164.5,260.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"146.2\" y=\"224.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M303.0,71.5 L177.0,8.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M177.0,8.5 L187.1,8.5 L183.0,16.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"245.2\" y=\"29.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M307.4,94.2 Q256.1,152.2 178.9,158.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M178.9,158.5 L187.5,153.2 L188.3,162.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"254.9\" y=\"149.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.9,304.8 C200.0,339.2 120.0,339.2 151.1,304.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M151.1,304.8 L148.4,314.5 L141.7,308.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"344.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,80.0 L-19.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,80.0 L-28.0,84.5 L-28.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">D</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"288.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"288.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 5 &mdash; Minimizaci\u00f3n</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>P1</strong> = {C} &nbsp; {A, B, D, \u2205} (finales y no finales).</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, B, D, \u2205}: con <code>a</code>, A, B y D van a B y \u2205 va a \u2205: todos dentro del mismo\n        grupo. Con <code>b</code>, A, B y D van a C (grupo {C}), pero \u2205 va a \u2205.\n        <strong>\u2205 se separa; A, B y D siguen juntos.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P2</strong> = {C} &nbsp; {A, B, D} &nbsp; {\u2205}</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, B, D}: con <code>a</code> los tres van a B; con <code>b</code> los tres van a C.\n        Se comportan igual.\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P3</strong> = P2: no cambia, se termina.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>A, B y D se juntan en un solo estado (lo llamamos A).</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 6 &mdash; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e5-min\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 433 130\" width=\"433\" height=\"130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,-7.8 Q80.0,-36.0 142.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,-7.8 L132.6,-7.4 L136.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M142.7,7.8 Q80.0,36.0 17.3,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M17.3,7.8 L27.4,7.4 L23.7,15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M311.1,-16.8 C280.0,-51.2 360.0,-51.2 328.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M328.9,-16.8 L331.6,-26.5 L338.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p>\n        AFD m\u00ednimo de tres estados: <code>A</code> (inicial), <code>C</code> (final) y el muerto\n        <code>\u2205</code>. A se queda en A con <code>a</code> y va a C con <code>b</code>; C vuelve a A\n        con <code>a</code> y va a \u2205 con <code>b</code>.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>b</code></td><td>A &rarr;b C</td><td>S\u00ed: cero bloques y la b</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>abab</code></td><td>A &rarr;a A &rarr;b C &rarr;a A &rarr;b C</td><td>S\u00ed: bloques <code>a</code>, <code>ba</code> y la b</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>abb</code></td><td>A &rarr;a A &rarr;b C &rarr;b \u2205</td><td>No: dos b seguidas</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>aba</code></td><td>A &rarr;a A &rarr;b C &rarr;a A</td><td>No: termina en a</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Una misma <code>b</code> lleva a dos lugares a la vez (al 5 y al 9): C es final <strong>y</strong> puede seguir. Eso lo resuelve solo la construcci\u00f3n de subconjuntos.</li>\n        <li>En la clausura del 6 hay que seguir la cadena de \u03b5 entera: 6 &rarr; 7 &rarr; 1 &rarr; 2, 3, y tambi\u00e9n 7 &rarr; 8.</li>\n        <li>Tres estados distintos (A, B y D) terminan siendo uno solo: no te asustes si el AFD sale grande, la minimizaci\u00f3n lo achica.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 2\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 2 del parcial (60 puntos), con otra ER.\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 6 &middot; ER &rarr; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <h2>x(y|z)*x</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Dada la siguiente ER, pasar a aut\u00f3mata determin\u00edstico m\u00ednimo: <strong>x(y|z)*x</strong></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 lenguaje genera</span>\n    <p>\n      Una <code>x</code>, despu\u00e9s cualquier mezcla de <code>y</code> y <code>z</code> (incluso nada), y\n      otra <code>x</code>. El alfabeto tiene <strong>tres</strong> s\u00edmbolos: la tabla lleva tres pares de\n      columnas. En palabras: <strong>empieza y termina en x, y en el medio solo hay y o z</strong>.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>xx</code>, <code>xyx</code>, <code>xzyzx</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>x</code>, <code>xy</code>, <code>xxx</code>, <code>yx</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Esto no es parte de la respuesta, pero sirve para controlar el AFD al final.</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; AFN-\u03b5 con Thompson</span>\n    <p>Se arma de adentro hacia afuera, en el orden en que se eval\u00faa la ER:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><code>y|z</code>: 3 &rarr;y 5 y 4 &rarr;z 6; un inicial (2) con \u03b5 a cada uno y un final (7) al que llegan los dos con \u03b5.</li>\n      <li><code>(y|z)*</code>: \u03b5 para entrar (1 &rarr; 2), \u03b5 de vuelta (7 &rarr; 2), \u03b5 para salir (7 &rarr; 8) y \u03b5 para saltearlo (1 &rarr; 8).</li>\n      <li>Las dos <code>x</code>, pegadas por concatenaci\u00f3n: el final de la primera es el inicial de la clausura (0 &rarr;x 1) y el final de la clausura es el inicial de la segunda (8 &rarr;x 9).</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e6-thompson\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -119 652 231\" width=\"652\" height=\"231\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para x(y|z)*x\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L61.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M61.0,0.0 L52.0,4.5 L52.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"40.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M259.0,-36.0 L301.0,-36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,-36.0 L292.0,-31.5 L292.0,-40.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"-46.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">y</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M259.0,36.0 L301.0,36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,36.0 L292.0,40.5 L292.0,31.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,-7.8 L222.7,-28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M222.7,-28.2 L216.3,-20.4 L212.6,-28.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"195.3\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,7.8 L222.7,28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M222.7,28.2 L212.6,28.6 L216.3,20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"204.7\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M337.3,-28.2 L382.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M382.7,-7.8 L372.6,-7.4 L376.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"364.7\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M337.3,28.2 L382.7,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M382.7,7.8 L376.3,15.6 L372.6,7.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"355.3\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M419.0,0.0 L461.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M461.0,0.0 L452.0,4.5 L452.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"440.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M388.6,-15.2 Q280.0,-160.0 171.4,-15.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M171.4,-15.2 L173.2,-25.1 L180.4,-19.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"-97.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M95.1,11.5 Q280.0,152.0 464.9,11.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M464.9,11.5 L460.4,20.5 L455.0,13.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"91.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M499.0,0.0 L541.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M541.0,0.0 L532.0,4.5 L532.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"520.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">6</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">7</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"480.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">8</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"560.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"560.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"560.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">9</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Subconjuntos (AFN-\u03b5 &rarr; AFD)</span>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Estado inicial:</strong> <code>A = \u03b5-clausura({0})</code>. Del 0 no salen \u03b5:\n      <code>A = {0}</code>. Con <code>x</code> va a <code>\u03b5-clausura({1}) = {1, 2, 3, 4, 8}</code> =\n      <code>B</code>.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <strong>C\u00f3mo sale cada casilla</strong>, con <code>B</code> y la <code>y</code>:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>mueve(B, y)</code>: de los estados de B, solo el 3 tiene flecha <code>y</code> (va al 5). Resultado: <code>{5}</code>.</li>\n      <li><code>\u03b5-clausura({5})</code>: 5 &rarr; 7; 7 &rarr; 2 (volver) y 7 &rarr; 8 (salir); 2 &rarr; 3 y 4. Resultado: <code>{2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8}</code> = <code>D</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>\n      Y con <code>B</code> y la <code>x</code>: la \u00fanica <code>x</code> que sale de B es 8 &rarr; 9, as\u00ed\n      que va a <code>{9}</code> = <code>C</code>, el \u00fanico final.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado del AFD</th><th>Estados de Thompson</th><th>mueve(T, x)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con x va a</th><th>mueve(T, y)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con y va a</th><th>mueve(T, z)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con z va a</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">A</td><td>{0}</td><td>{1}</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 4, 8} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B</td><td>{1, 2, 3, 4, 8}</td><td>{9}</td><td>{9} = <strong>C</strong></td><td>{5}</td><td>{2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8} = <strong>D</strong></td><td>{6}</td><td>{2, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8} = <strong>E</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C (final)</td><td>{9}</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D</td><td>{2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8}</td><td>{9}</td><td>{9} = <strong>C</strong></td><td>{5}</td><td>{2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8} = <strong>D</strong></td><td>{6}</td><td>{2, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8} = <strong>E</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">E</td><td>{2, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8}</td><td>{9}</td><td>{9} = <strong>C</strong></td><td>{5}</td><td>{2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8} = <strong>D</strong></td><td>{6}</td><td>{2, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8} = <strong>E</strong></td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Finales del AFD:</strong> los que contienen el final de Thompson (el 9). Solo\n      <code>C</code>.\n    </p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; El AFD</span>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>x</th><th>y</th><th>z</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; A</td><td>B</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B</td><td>C</td><td>D</td><td>E</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C *</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D</td><td>C</td><td>D</td><td>E</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">E</td><td>C</td><td>D</td><td>E</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e6-afd\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -157 540 586\" width=\"540\" height=\"586\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,80.0 L141.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,80.0 L132.0,84.5 L132.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"70.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M9.6,96.4 L150.4,335.6\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M150.4,335.6 L141.9,330.1 L149.7,325.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"99.9\" y=\"204.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">y, z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M175.8,90.5 L432.2,261.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M432.2,261.5 L422.2,260.2 L427.2,252.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"310.7\" y=\"165.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M175.1,68.4 L352.9,-68.4\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M352.9,-68.4 L348.6,-59.4 L343.1,-66.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"256.5\" y=\"-9.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">y</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,80.0 L277.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M277.0,80.0 L268.0,84.5 L268.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"228.0\" y=\"70.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M429.7,277.1 L178.3,346.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M178.3,346.9 L185.8,340.2 L188.2,348.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"299.4\" y=\"295.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x, y, z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M372.2,-61.5 L443.8,253.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M443.8,253.5 L437.4,245.7 L446.2,243.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"421.4\" y=\"93.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M359.1,-96.8 C328.0,-131.2 408.0,-131.2 376.9,-96.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M376.9,-96.8 L379.6,-106.5 L386.3,-100.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"368.0\" y=\"-136.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">y</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M367.4,-61.0 Q364.8,14.8 309.8,66.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M309.8,66.9 L313.2,57.5 L319.4,64.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"364.0\" y=\"14.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M307.8,94.9 L436.2,257.1\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M436.2,257.1 L427.1,252.8 L434.1,247.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"382.2\" y=\"167.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M296.6,61.0 Q299.2,-14.8 354.2,-66.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M354.2,-66.9 L350.8,-57.5 L344.6,-64.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"300.0\" y=\"-14.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">y</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M304.9,96.8 C336.0,131.2 256.0,131.2 287.1,96.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M287.1,96.8 L284.4,106.5 L277.7,100.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"296.0\" y=\"136.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.9,368.8 C200.0,403.2 120.0,403.2 151.1,368.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M151.1,368.8 L148.4,378.5 L141.7,372.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"408.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x, y, z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,80.0 L-19.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,80.0 L-28.0,84.5 L-28.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"296.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"296.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">E</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"368.0\" cy=\"-80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"368.0\" y=\"-80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">D</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"448.0\" cy=\"272.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"448.0\" cy=\"272.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"448.0\" y=\"272.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"352.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"352.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 5 &mdash; Minimizaci\u00f3n</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>P1</strong> = {C} &nbsp; {A, B, D, E, \u2205} (finales y no finales).</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, B, D, E, \u2205}: con <code>x</code>, B, D y E van a C (grupo {C}), pero A va a B y \u2205 va\n        a \u2205 (los dos dentro del grupo grande). Con <code>y</code> y con <code>z</code> todos se quedan\n        en el grupo grande. <strong>Se parte en {A, \u2205} y {B, D, E}.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P2</strong> = {C} &nbsp; {A, \u2205} &nbsp; {B, D, E}</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, \u2205}: con <code>x</code>, A va a B (ahora grupo {B, D, E}) y \u2205 va a \u2205 (grupo {A, \u2205}).\n        <strong>Se separan.</strong> En P1 no se ve\u00eda porque B y \u2205 estaban en el mismo grupo.\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {B, D, E}: con <code>x</code> los tres van a C; con <code>y</code>, a D; con\n        <code>z</code>, a E. Se comportan igual.\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P3</strong> = {C} &nbsp; {A} &nbsp; {\u2205} &nbsp; {B, D, E}</li>\n      <li><strong>P4</strong> = P3: no cambia, se termina.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>B, D y E se juntan en un solo estado (lo llamamos B).</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 6 &mdash; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e6-min\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 412 314\" width=\"412\" height=\"314\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M13.4,13.4 L146.6,146.6\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M146.6,146.6 L137.0,143.4 L143.4,137.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"94.7\" y=\"65.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">y, z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M151.1,-16.8 C120.0,-51.2 200.0,-51.2 168.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.9,-16.8 L171.6,-26.5 L178.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">y, z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M306.6,13.4 L173.4,146.6\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M173.4,146.6 L176.6,137.0 L183.0,143.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"219.6\" y=\"59.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x, y, z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.9,176.8 C200.0,211.2 120.0,211.2 151.1,176.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M151.1,176.8 L148.4,186.5 L141.7,180.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"216.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x, y, z</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p>\n        AFD m\u00ednimo de cuatro estados: <code>A</code> (inicial), <code>B</code>, <code>C</code>\n        (final) y el muerto <code>\u2205</code>. A va a B con <code>x</code>; B se queda en B con\n        <code>y</code> o <code>z</code> y va a C con <code>x</code>. Todo lo dem\u00e1s va a \u2205.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>xx</code></td><td>A &rarr;x B &rarr;x C</td><td>S\u00ed: nada en el medio</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>xzyx</code></td><td>A &rarr;x B &rarr;z B &rarr;y B &rarr;x C</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>xyxx</code></td><td>A &rarr;x B &rarr;y B &rarr;x C &rarr;x \u2205</td><td>No: despu\u00e9s de la segunda x no va nada</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>xy</code></td><td>A &rarr;x B &rarr;y B</td><td>No: falta la x del final</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Con tres s\u00edmbolos son tres casillas por fila: es f\u00e1cil saltearse la <code>z</code> y dejar el AFD incompleto.</li>\n        <li>Cortar la minimizaci\u00f3n en P2 porque \"ya se separ\u00f3 algo\": se sigue hasta que una ronda no cambie nada. Ac\u00e1 A y \u2205 reci\u00e9n se separan en P3.</li>\n        <li>En cada ronda se mira a qu\u00e9 grupo <strong>de la partici\u00f3n anterior</strong> va cada estado, no a qu\u00e9 estado.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 2\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 2 del parcial (60 puntos), con otra ER.\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 7 &middot; ER &rarr; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <h2>a(a|b)*b|b(a|b)*</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Dada la siguiente ER, pasar a aut\u00f3mata determin\u00edstico m\u00ednimo: <strong>a(a|b)*b|b(a|b)*</strong></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 lenguaje genera</span>\n    <p>\n      El <code>|</code> de afuera parte la ER en dos: <code>a(a|b)*b</code> (empieza en a y termina en\n      b) o <code>b(a|b)*</code> (empieza en b, y despu\u00e9s cualquier cosa). En palabras:\n      <strong>las cadenas que empiezan en b, o que empiezan en a y terminan en b</strong>.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>b</code>, <code>ba</code>, <code>ab</code>, <code>aab</code>, <code>abab</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>a</code>, <code>aba</code>, <code>aa</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Esto no es parte de la respuesta, pero sirve para controlar el AFD al final.</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; AFN-\u03b5 con Thompson</span>\n    <p>Se arma de adentro hacia afuera, en el orden en que se eval\u00faa la ER. Cada rama tiene su propio <code>(a|b)*</code>, con sus estados:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Rama de arriba, <code>(a|b)*</code>: el <code>a|b</code> va de 5 a 15 (7 &rarr;a 11, 8 &rarr;b 12); la clausura agrega entrar (3 &rarr; 5), volver (15 &rarr; 5), salir (15 &rarr; 17) y saltear (3 &rarr; 17).</li>\n      <li>Rama de arriba completa: 1 &rarr;a 3, la clausura, y 17 &rarr;b 19.</li>\n      <li>Rama de abajo, <code>b(a|b)*</code>: 2 &rarr;b 4 y otra clausura igual, del 4 al 18 (con el 6 y el 16 como inicial y final del <code>a|b</code>).</li>\n      <li>El <code>|</code> de afuera: inicial 0 con \u03b5 al 1 y al 2; final 20, al que llegan el 19 y el 18 con \u03b5.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e7-thompson\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -247 812 491\" width=\"812\" height=\"491\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para a(a|b)*b|b(a|b)*\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,-128.0 L141.0,-128.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,-128.0 L132.0,-123.5 L132.0,-132.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-138.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M339.0,-164.0 L381.0,-164.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M381.0,-164.0 L372.0,-159.5 L372.0,-168.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"-174.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M339.0,-92.0 L381.0,-92.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M381.0,-92.0 L372.0,-87.5 L372.0,-96.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"-102.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M257.3,-135.8 L302.7,-156.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,-156.2 L296.3,-148.4 L292.6,-156.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"275.3\" y=\"-156.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M257.3,-120.2 L302.7,-99.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,-99.8 L292.6,-99.4 L296.3,-107.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"284.7\" y=\"-120.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M417.3,-156.2 L462.7,-135.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M462.7,-135.8 L452.6,-135.4 L456.3,-143.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"444.7\" y=\"-156.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M417.3,-99.8 L462.7,-120.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M462.7,-120.2 L456.3,-112.4 L452.6,-120.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"435.3\" y=\"-120.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,-128.0 L221.0,-128.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,-128.0 L212.0,-123.5 L212.0,-132.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-138.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M499.0,-128.0 L541.0,-128.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M541.0,-128.0 L532.0,-123.5 L532.0,-132.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"520.0\" y=\"-138.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M468.6,-143.2 Q360.0,-288.0 251.4,-143.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M251.4,-143.2 L253.2,-153.1 L260.4,-147.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"-225.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M175.1,-116.5 Q360.0,24.0 544.9,-116.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M544.9,-116.5 L540.4,-107.5 L535.0,-114.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"-36.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M579.0,-128.0 L621.0,-128.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M621.0,-128.0 L612.0,-123.5 L612.0,-132.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"-138.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,132.0 L141.0,132.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,132.0 L132.0,136.5 L132.0,127.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"122.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M339.0,96.0 L381.0,96.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M381.0,96.0 L372.0,100.5 L372.0,91.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"86.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M339.0,168.0 L381.0,168.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M381.0,168.0 L372.0,172.5 L372.0,163.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"158.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M257.3,124.2 L302.7,103.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,103.8 L296.3,111.6 L292.6,103.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"275.3\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M257.3,139.8 L302.7,160.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,160.2 L292.6,160.6 L296.3,152.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"284.7\" y=\"139.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M417.3,103.8 L462.7,124.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M462.7,124.2 L452.6,124.6 L456.3,116.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"444.7\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M417.3,160.2 L462.7,139.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M462.7,139.8 L456.3,147.6 L452.6,139.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"435.3\" y=\"139.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,132.0 L221.0,132.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,132.0 L212.0,136.5 L212.0,127.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"122.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M499.0,132.0 L541.0,132.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M541.0,132.0 L532.0,136.5 L532.0,127.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"520.0\" y=\"122.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M468.6,116.8 Q360.0,-28.0 251.4,116.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M251.4,116.8 L253.2,106.9 L260.4,112.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"34.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M175.1,143.5 Q360.0,284.0 544.9,143.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M544.9,143.5 L540.4,152.5 L535.0,145.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"223.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M10.1,-16.1 L69.9,-111.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M69.9,-111.9 L69.0,-101.9 L61.3,-106.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"28.8\" y=\"-71.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M9.8,16.2 L70.2,115.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M70.2,115.8 L61.6,110.4 L69.3,105.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"51.3\" y=\"59.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M650.1,-111.9 L709.9,-16.1\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M709.9,-16.1 L701.3,-21.4 L709.0,-26.1 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"691.2\" y=\"-71.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M574.7,119.9 L705.3,12.1\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M705.3,12.1 L701.3,21.3 L695.5,14.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"632.1\" y=\"56.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"-128.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-128.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"-128.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-128.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"-164.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"-164.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">7</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"-164.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"-164.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">11</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"-92.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"-92.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">8</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"-92.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"-92.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">12</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"-128.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-128.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"-128.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"480.0\" y=\"-128.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">15</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"560.0\" cy=\"-128.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"560.0\" y=\"-128.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">17</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"640.0\" cy=\"-128.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"640.0\" y=\"-128.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">19</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"132.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"132.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"132.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"132.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"96.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"96.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">9</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"96.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"96.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">13</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"168.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"168.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">10</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"168.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"168.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">14</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"132.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"132.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">6</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"132.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"480.0\" y=\"132.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">16</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"560.0\" cy=\"132.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"560.0\" y=\"132.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">18</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"720.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"720.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"720.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">20</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Subconjuntos (AFN-\u03b5 &rarr; AFD)</span>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Estado inicial:</strong> <code>A = \u03b5-clausura({0}) = {0, 1, 2}</code>.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <strong>C\u00f3mo sale cada casilla</strong>, con <code>B = {3, 5, 7, 8, 17}</code> y la <code>b</code>:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>mueve(B, b)</code>: dos flechas <code>b</code>: 8 &rarr; 12 (la b de adentro del <code>*</code>) y 17 &rarr; 19 (la b del final). Resultado: <code>{12, 19}</code>.</li>\n      <li><code>\u03b5-clausura({12, 19})</code>: 12 &rarr; 15; 15 &rarr; 5 y 17; 5 &rarr; 7 y 8; 19 &rarr; 20. Resultado: <code>{5, 7, 8, 12, 15, 17, 19, 20}</code> = <code>E</code>. Tiene al 20: es final (la cadena termin\u00f3 en b).</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>\n      Con <code>A</code> y la <code>b</code>: <code>mueve(A, b) = {4}</code> y\n      <code>\u03b5-clausura({4}) = {4, 6, 9, 10, 18, 20}</code> = <code>C</code>, final de entrada: la\n      <code>b</code> sola ya se acepta.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado del AFD</th><th>Estados de Thompson</th><th>mueve(T, a)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con a va a</th><th>mueve(T, b)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con b va a</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">A</td><td>{0, 1, 2}</td><td>{3}</td><td>{3, 5, 7, 8, 17} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>{4}</td><td>{4, 6, 9, 10, 18, 20} = <strong>C</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B</td><td>{3, 5, 7, 8, 17}</td><td>{11}</td><td>{5, 7, 8, 11, 15, 17} = <strong>D</strong></td><td>{12, 19}</td><td>{5, 7, 8, 12, 15, 17, 19, 20} = <strong>E</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C (final)</td><td>{4, 6, 9, 10, 18, 20}</td><td>{13}</td><td>{6, 9, 10, 13, 16, 18, 20} = <strong>F</strong></td><td>{14}</td><td>{6, 9, 10, 14, 16, 18, 20} = <strong>G</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D</td><td>{5, 7, 8, 11, 15, 17}</td><td>{11}</td><td>{5, 7, 8, 11, 15, 17} = <strong>D</strong></td><td>{12, 19}</td><td>{5, 7, 8, 12, 15, 17, 19, 20} = <strong>E</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">E (final)</td><td>{5, 7, 8, 12, 15, 17, 19, 20}</td><td>{11}</td><td>{5, 7, 8, 11, 15, 17} = <strong>D</strong></td><td>{12, 19}</td><td>{5, 7, 8, 12, 15, 17, 19, 20} = <strong>E</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">F (final)</td><td>{6, 9, 10, 13, 16, 18, 20}</td><td>{13}</td><td>{6, 9, 10, 13, 16, 18, 20} = <strong>F</strong></td><td>{14}</td><td>{6, 9, 10, 14, 16, 18, 20} = <strong>G</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">G (final)</td><td>{6, 9, 10, 14, 16, 18, 20}</td><td>{13}</td><td>{6, 9, 10, 13, 16, 18, 20} = <strong>F</strong></td><td>{14}</td><td>{6, 9, 10, 14, 16, 18, 20} = <strong>G</strong></td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      <strong>Finales del AFD:</strong> los que contienen el final de Thompson (el 20):\n      <code>C</code>, <code>E</code>, <code>F</code> y <code>G</code>. Ning\u00fan <code>mueve</code> dio\n      vac\u00edo, as\u00ed que este AFD <strong>no tiene estado muerto</strong>.\n    </p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; El AFD</span>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; A</td><td>B</td><td>C</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B</td><td>D</td><td>E</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C *</td><td>F</td><td>G</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D</td><td>D</td><td>E</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">E *</td><td>D</td><td>E</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">F *</td><td>F</td><td>G</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">G *</td><td>F</td><td>G</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e7-afd\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -52 452 504\" width=\"452\" height=\"504\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M14.8,188.1 L145.2,83.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M145.2,83.9 L140.9,93.0 L135.3,86.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"72.3\" y=\"126.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M14.8,211.9 L145.2,316.1\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M145.2,316.1 L135.3,314.0 L140.9,307.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"87.7\" y=\"254.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,64.2 L302.7,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,7.8 L296.3,15.6 L292.6,7.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"235.3\" y=\"25.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,79.8 L302.7,136.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,136.2 L292.6,136.6 L296.3,128.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"244.7\" y=\"97.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,320.2 L302.7,263.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,263.8 L296.3,271.6 L292.6,263.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"235.3\" y=\"281.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,335.8 L302.7,392.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,392.2 L292.6,392.6 L296.3,384.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"244.7\" y=\"353.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M336.8,-8.9 C371.2,-40.0 371.2,40.0 336.8,8.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M336.8,8.9 L346.5,11.6 L340.4,18.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"374.8\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M328.5,17.0 Q356.0,72.0 328.5,127.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M328.5,127.0 L328.5,116.9 L336.5,121.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"356.0\" y=\"72.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M311.5,127.0 Q284.0,72.0 311.5,17.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M311.5,17.0 L311.5,27.1 L303.5,23.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"284.0\" y=\"72.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M336.8,135.1 C371.2,104.0 371.2,184.0 336.8,152.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M336.8,152.9 L346.5,155.6 L340.4,162.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"374.8\" y=\"144.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M336.8,247.1 C371.2,216.0 371.2,296.0 336.8,264.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M336.8,264.9 L346.5,267.6 L340.4,274.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"374.8\" y=\"256.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M328.5,273.0 Q356.0,328.0 328.5,383.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M328.5,383.0 L328.5,372.9 L336.5,377.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"356.0\" y=\"328.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M311.5,383.0 Q284.0,328.0 311.5,273.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M311.5,273.0 L311.5,283.1 L303.5,279.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"284.0\" y=\"328.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M336.8,391.1 C371.2,360.0 371.2,440.0 336.8,408.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M336.8,408.9 L346.5,411.6 L340.4,418.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"374.8\" y=\"400.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,200.0 L-19.0,200.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,200.0 L-28.0,204.5 L-28.0,195.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"200.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"200.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"72.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"72.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">D</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"144.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"144.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"144.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">E</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"328.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"328.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"328.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"256.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"256.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"256.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">F</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"400.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"400.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"400.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">G</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 5 &mdash; Minimizaci\u00f3n</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>P1</strong> = {C, E, F, G} &nbsp; {A, B, D} (finales y no finales).</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {C, E, F, G}: con <code>b</code> los cuatro van a finales. Con <code>a</code>, C, F y G\n        van a F (finales), pero E va a D (no finales). <strong>E se separa.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, B, D}: con <code>a</code>, los tres van a B o D (no finales). Con <code>b</code>, A va\n        a C y B y D van a E: los dos son finales, el mismo grupo en P1. <strong>No se separan\n        todav\u00eda.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P2</strong> = {C, F, G} &nbsp; {E} &nbsp; {A, B, D}</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, B, D}: ahora C y E est\u00e1n en grupos distintos. Con <code>b</code>, A va a C (grupo\n        {C, F, G}) y B y D van a E (grupo {E}). <strong>A se separa; B y D siguen juntos.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li>Grupo {C, F, G}: con <code>a</code> los tres van a F; con <code>b</code>, a G. No se separan.</li>\n      <li><strong>P3</strong> = {C, F, G} &nbsp; {E} &nbsp; {A} &nbsp; {B, D}</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {B, D}: con <code>a</code> los dos van a D; con <code>b</code>, a E. Grupo {C, F, G}:\n        igual que antes. Nada se separa.\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P4</strong> = P3: no cambia, se termina.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>B y D se juntan (lo llamamos B); C, F y G se juntan (lo llamamos C).</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 6 &mdash; AFD m\u00ednimo</span>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-e7-min\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 433 289\" width=\"433\" height=\"289\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.0,71.5 L143.0,8.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.0,8.5 L137.0,16.5 L132.9,8.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"74.8\" y=\"29.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.0,88.5 L143.0,151.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.0,151.5 L132.9,151.5 L137.0,143.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"85.2\" y=\"109.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M151.1,-16.8 C120.0,-51.2 200.0,-51.2 168.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.9,-16.8 L171.6,-26.5 L178.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,-7.8 Q240.0,-36.0 302.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,-7.8 L292.6,-7.4 L296.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M302.7,7.8 Q240.0,36.0 177.3,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M177.3,7.8 L187.4,7.4 L183.7,15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M311.1,-16.8 C280.0,-51.2 360.0,-51.2 328.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M328.9,-16.8 L331.6,-26.5 L338.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M176.8,151.1 C211.2,120.0 211.2,200.0 176.8,168.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M176.8,168.9 L186.5,171.6 L180.4,178.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"226.2\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,80.0 L-19.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,80.0 L-28.0,84.5 L-28.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">E</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p>\n        AFD m\u00ednimo de cuatro estados, sin estado muerto: <code>A</code> (inicial), <code>B</code>,\n        <code>C</code> y <code>E</code> (finales). Con <code>b</code>, A va a C, que se queda en C con\n        todo. Con <code>a</code>, A va a B; B se queda en B con <code>a</code> y va a E con\n        <code>b</code>; E se queda en E con <code>b</code> y vuelve a B con <code>a</code>.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>ba</code></td><td>A &rarr;b C &rarr;a C</td><td>S\u00ed: empieza en b</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>aab</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B &rarr;a B &rarr;b E</td><td>S\u00ed: empieza en a y termina en b</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>aba</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B &rarr;b E &rarr;a B</td><td>No: empieza en a y termina en a</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>a</code></td><td>A &rarr;a B</td><td>No: B no es final</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Las dos ramas tienen cada una su <code>(a|b)*</code> con estados propios: no se comparte la clausura entre las dos.</li>\n        <li>Mirando P1, A, B y D parecen iguales porque C y E todav\u00eda est\u00e1n en el mismo grupo. Reci\u00e9n al separarse E aparece la diferencia: hace falta la tercera ronda.</li>\n        <li>El \u2205 aparece solo si alguna casilla da vac\u00edo. Ac\u00e1 no pasa, as\u00ed que no se dibuja: no se inventa.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>");
